---
system: sys-06-content-and-personalization
flow_id: retrieval
surface: internal-RPC
spec_anchor: /software/systems/06-content-and-personalization#post-internal-v1-personalization-retrieve
actors: [SafetyService, ContentService, PostgreSQL, Redis]
apis:
  - POST /internal/v1/personalization/retrieve
externals: [Redis]
queues:
  - cp-retrieval-analytics
failure_paths:
  - policy_key_unknown
  - over_budget_trim_and_cap
  - redis_unavailable_in_memory_fallback
  - sensitive_data_blocked
idempotency: conversationRequestId — duplicate requests return existing retrieval_snapshot row
retry: 0 — latency budget does not allow retry; caller (System 05) proceeds with empty personalization on timeout
timeout: 500ms p99 — total payload <=1800 chars truncated if exceeded
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED — normalized from _seed.1 (06-content#L1490).
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SafetyService
    participant ContentService
    participant PostgreSQL
    participant Redis

    SafetyService->>ContentService: POST /internal/v1/personalization/retrieve {conversationRequestId, childProfileId, locale, ageBand, topicHints}
    alt policy_key_unknown
        ContentService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT allowlisted trait/preference keys
        PostgreSQL-->>ContentService: key not in policy classification
        ContentService-->>SafetyService: 400 policy_key_unknown
    else over_budget_trim_and_cap
        ContentService->>PostgreSQL: load traits and prefs and approved memories
        ContentService->>Redis: HGET cooldowns for templates
        ContentService->>ContentService: score and rank candidates
        Note over ContentService: total payload > 1800 chars — trim by salience and recency
        ContentService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT retrieval_snapshots row trimmed=true
        ContentService-->>SafetyService: {traits<=5, prefs<=5, memories<=3, templates<=5} truncated
    else redis_unavailable_in_memory_fallback
        ContentService->>PostgreSQL: load traits and prefs and memories
        ContentService->>Redis: HGET cooldowns
        Redis--xContentService: connection error
        Note over ContentService: degrade — in-memory cooldown fallback, log degradation metric
        ContentService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT retrieval_snapshots row degraded=true
        ContentService-->>SafetyService: bounded retrieval (cooldown best-effort)
    else sensitive_data_blocked
        ContentService->>PostgreSQL: load traits filtered by policy classification
        Note over ContentService: traits with blocked_realtime classification dropped
        ContentService-->>SafetyService: bounded retrieval (sensitive fields omitted)
    else success
        ContentService->>PostgreSQL: load traits and prefs and approved+eligible memories
        ContentService->>Redis: HGET content:cooldown:{childProfileId}
        Redis-->>ContentService: cooldown set
        ContentService->>ContentService: score and rank and diversity cap
        ContentService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT retrieval_snapshots row
        ContentService-)ContentService: emit cp-retrieval-analytics
        ContentService-->>SafetyService: {traits, preferences, memorySummaries, contentTemplates, retrievalPolicy}
    end
    Note over SafetyService,Redis: retrieval is bounded — allowed_realtime classification only — never raw parent notes
